{"availability":"available","full":"techAsmita/AI-Search-Assistant","name":"AI-Search-Assistant","description":"🔍 An AI-powered search assistant inspired by Perplexity — get Markdown-formatted answers, test your knowledge with Quiz Mode, and revisit past searches with local history. Built with Flutter Web + FastAPI, powered by Google Gemini.","category":"Education","language":"Dart","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-08-28T05:23:31Z","updated":"2026-08-28T07:17:55Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://ai-search-assistant-six.vercel.app/","topics":["chatbot","flutter","flutter-web","generative-ai","python","render","vercel"],"demo":"https://ai-search-assistant-six.vercel.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T21:28:03.108Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T21:28:03.108Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T21:28:03.108Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T21:28:03.108Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python","Flutter"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["An AI-powered answer assistant inspired by Perplexity — featuring Markdown-formatted answers, a built-in Quiz Mode, and local search history.","Perplexity Clone is a full-stack AI search assistant that lets users ask questions and receive clear, well-structured answers powered by Google Gemini. The frontend is built with Flutter Web for a responsive, cross-platform UI, while a FastAPI backend handles AI requests and quiz generation. It also includes a Quiz Mode that turns any answer into a set of multiple-choice questions, along with locally stored search history for quick access to past queries."],"features":["🤖 AI-powered question answering using Google Gemini","📝 Markdown-formatted answers for clean, readable responses","🧠 Quiz Mode — auto-generates multiple-choice questions from any answer","🕘 Local history of previous searches for quick recall","📱 Responsive, collapsible sidebar for a smooth experience across screen sizes"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/techAsmita/AI-Sea